WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Ryu falls after the ground-hit heavy Tatsu.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.050
Raw Drive Rush closes the gap.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.550
Drive Rush standing heavy punch connects on wake-up.

4
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.300
A second standing heavy punch continues the hit conversion.

5
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:02.800
Heavy Adamant Flame connects.

6
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.600
Adamant Flame’s forward-punch follow-up launches Ryu.

7
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.300
Ryu lands after the Flame follow-up.
